F2BackslashReverse --> AuroraRackF2
F2PipeForward --> BeaconArchiveF2
F2PipeReverse --> AuroraRackF2
F2SlashForward --> BeaconArchiveF2
F2SlashReverse --> AuroraRackF2
F2DeployAlpha00 --> AuroraRackF2
F2DeployAlpha01 --> BeaconArchiveF2
F2DeployAlpha7F --> AuroraRackF2
F2DeployAlpha80 --> BeaconArchiveF2
F2DeployAlphaFE --> AuroraRackF2
F2DeployAlphaFF --> BeaconArchiveF2
F2DeployTransparent --> AuroraRackF2
F2DeployBackground --> BeaconArchiveF2
